  "design_rules": [
    "No free-cash button: every robbery creates risk, witnesses, security response and police consequences.",
    "Story mode may use authored protagonist reactions and relationship consequences.",
    "Online mode resolves rewards, cooldowns, heat and ownership on the server.",
    "Robberies can begin without a mission marker; missions may later reference the consequences of a previous freemode robbery.",
    "A robbery can fail without becoming a scripted mission, and the player can abandon it and return to free roam."
  ]
